	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"eval", exp="g.no231=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020190"},
		line=330,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We decide to remain as lovers until the sun rises.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This... makes me feel sorta weird.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, me too.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Hotori nestles her shoulder comfortably against mine.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"All we've been doing since we've come back to my room is sit next to each other like this.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"But this alone is enough to make my heart soar.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I haven't spent that much time with you in your room up until now, right?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...It's because I was always holding myself back.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whenever we're alone together like this, it's hard for me to hold back my feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even before the war, I tried my best to not get any closer to you than I had to.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I thought you'd never reciprocate my feelings no matter what.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even still, I couldn't stop myself...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When the war started, I realized we might not live to see tomorrow, and I couldn't just do nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The day the Republic invaded, Hotori confessed her feelings to me.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"If I hadn't lost my memories in the war, would I have accepted them?",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I'm not sure why, but for some reason, I feel like I would've rejected her.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"The only reason I love Hotori now is because of all we've been through the past three years.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Caressing my cheek, Hotori fixes me with a wanton gaze of longing.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"I answer her puckered lips with my own.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah, nh... *smack...*”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori looks up at me with a melty expression and glazed, puppy dog eyes.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Can I make... just one more request?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're lovers, aren’t we? I'll do anything for you.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks... Umm, could you...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please hold me tight?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Like this?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I wrap my arms around her slender shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, just this makes me so happy... But that's not what I mean...”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I want you to make me yours, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"I understand what Hotori is trying to say.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Our tight embrace and long kiss inflamed my passions, and I yearn for a deeper connection with her.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you sure about this, Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah. I wanna do it... with you.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I want to give my everything... to you.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Hotori seductively whispers as she leans even deeper into my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"After holding each other and exchanging many kisses, Hotori looked at me and smiled.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehee...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You looked so desperate... I've never seen you like that before.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Her vexed expression is so adorable that I can't stop myself from embracing her.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I bury my face in her neck and fill myself up with her scent.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Shyly settling into my embrace, Hotori languidly reaches out and strokes my hair.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've never felt happier than when I was connected with you.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I could die right now with absolutely no regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't ever let you die.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You can't say that... You should be protecting your lord above all else.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't let my lord die, either. I'll protect the both of you.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're one insatiable man.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, maybe I am.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I'd always felt like a leaf on the wind, never wanting for anything in life.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"But as it turns out, I'm far more covetous than I had ever reckoned.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"For I'll never be satisfied unless my lord and my lover are both by my side, and I'll never rest so long as I can protect them both with my own two hands.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The night is still young...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah. You're right...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"...May the sun never rise tomorrow morning.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Our noses close enough to touch, Hotori stares longingly into my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I stare right back into those refreshing pools of azure.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I want to feel you... more and more...”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Me too.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Her eyelids flutter close.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nnh... Mwah...”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"My lips helplessly drawn into hers, I give her a gentle kiss.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
